m2.36z0006y24a0pmz0001.surf.dat

M = 2.36Msun, Z = 0.0006, [Fe/H] = -1.4

a0 => no alpha enhancement
a4 => [alpha/Fe] = +0.4 

pmz0001 => PMZ = 0.001 Msun 
   size of the partial mixing zone that will be converted into a 13C pocket
   needed for formation of s-process elements in low-mass AGB stars 
   (see Shingles et al. 2015) 

pmz0 => no partial mixing zone
   
